{"name": "RESEED", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>RESEED</strong> is a puzzle platformer built around planning and execution where each level happens in two phases:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Phase 1 \u2013 Record</strong> <br/>Record a path though an empty level to guide the seed safely to the end of the level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Phase 2 \u2013 Execute</strong> <br/>Witness the seed execute the path you recorded, in the same level, now full of traps. And see if it survives...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/0088d2eee8ee032b0ea51f2d7c3367db.poster.avif?t=1776352936\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/0088d2eee8ee032b0ea51f2d7c3367db.webm?t=1776352936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/0088d2eee8ee032b0ea51f2d7c3367db.mp4?t=1776352936\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"44\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/ee6b133af99ab81f6fc6cbb5b48bdaf3.webp?t=1776352936\" width=\"616\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">   Success won\u2019t come on your first try. Learn from each mistake, refine your memory, and perfect your route as levels grow increasingly complex with new traps and mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/415e67620d403c9535490f4e41f7e770.poster.avif?t=1776352936\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/415e67620d403c9535490f4e41f7e770.webm?t=1776352936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/415e67620d403c9535490f4e41f7e770.mp4?t=1776352936\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"44\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/3a38e273cef9658158d2d822fb9a9b47.webp?t=1776352936\" width=\"616\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect golden seeds throughout the levels to unlock special missions and discover unique gameplay twists that will put your skills to test.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/61e131cd56faa5db942d287e8ff4f5c4.poster.avif?t=1776352936\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/61e131cd56faa5db942d287e8ff4f5c4.webm?t=1776352936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/61e131cd56faa5db942d287e8ff4f5c4.mp4?t=1776352936\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"44\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/c05e175dde6f2cee71280c38279d24c2.webp?t=1776352936\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rescue every seed and bring them back to your ship to complete your mission!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/b368d6682e043d5e6d8df8d64d803212.poster.avif?t=1776352936\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/b368d6682e043d5e6d8df8d64d803212.webm?t=1776352936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/b368d6682e043d5e6d8df8d64d803212.mp4?t=1776352936\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "RESEED is a puzzle platformer about planning. Record your path through a safe level, then watch it execute through the same level, now filled with traps. Will the seed survive?", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/080573cc11f6e34975057c007e7855af164a8f22/header.jpg?t=1776352936", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Puzzle Platformer", "Precision Platformer", "Platformer", "Puzzle", "Adventure", "Pixel Graphics"], "developers": "Headless Division", "publishers": "Headless Division", "release_date": "Apr 16, 2026", "price": "$2.99", "appid": "3954440", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "16 April 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/bvRIRU087h4", "first_seen": 1776290400.0, "review_rank": 872}